grimoire-linux (0.3.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * VaultL: the Type column speaks the user's language; sizes and dates read right in RTL
  * MuraL: a video wallpaper's thumbnail can't hang its worker
  * Names with "&" show the "&" in crumbs, tabs and menus
  * SettingL: key repeat units are translated
  * RTL: page headings sit on the start side, whatever the name in them
  * Settings files holding the wrong kind of JSON no longer break pages
  * Renames never replace something that appeared after the check
  * Archives: extract and compress never replace a file that appears at the last moment
  * Tooltips show other people's text as typed, never as HTML
  * ViewL: the folder heading sits on the start side in RTL
  * VaultL: file names keep their own direction in an RTL UI

